    "title": "NHTSA Investigates Ram ProMaster Vans Over Sudden Power Steering Failure - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alex Harrington ,\n6 hours ago Stellantis, © 2022 Stellantis NHTSA has opened an investigation into 2022-2023 Ram ProMaster vans after it was reported that the vehicles could lose their power steering without any warning. This comes after the Office of Defects Investigation received 19 Vehicle Owner Questionnaires linked to this issue. The issue covers the ProMaster 1500, 2500 and 3500 variants across the 2022-2023 … The post NHTSA Investigates Ram ProMaster Vans Over Sudden Power Steering Failure appeared first on MotorBiscuit . Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
